        "created_at": "2021-06-02T20:56:11.640Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Near Mint, after getting drunk on the power of two stacked Cosmic Immolations…</p>\n<p>Second time around everything went right to trample Gloomy - between Applied Numerology, Counterpoint Bulwark, and Terminarch’s Casing I was able to keep a Cosmic Immolation in play, making Lifeline an absolute monster. For the last round I went all out and played a second Immolation.</p>\n<p>So. Much. Damage.</p>",
