        "created_at": "2021-06-02T23:30:40.003Z",
        "cooked": "<p>First attempt was a wash. Everything was going fine until Imbued Vitality came out the round he flipped and summoned two Profane Zealots and two Cursed Acolytes. He killed all my stuff and there was no recovering from that. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=9\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\"></p>",
