        "read": false,
        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Second attempt made it in! I won't say it was anxiety-free, but once I passed the point of no return from my last game, it was actually quite easy. And all that changed was I was able to use Nightmist to bounce a Portal Fiend's damage into the Cursed Acolyte the turn Imbued Vitality came out. (He got played on someone else's turn.) Then it's no trouble to soak the 4 damage and blow up the environment card with Argent Adept!",
